  "rules": "> *\"With great power comes great complication.\"* — Every action has weight in a world shaped by supers. These special rules reflect the dramatic highs, brutal costs, and cinematic moments that define solo superhero stories.\n\nSignature Power Surge:\n\nOnce per mission, when the protagonist uses a **signature power** in a context where it would dramatically shift the scene, you may declare a **Power Surge**.\n- Skip the Oracle entirely. The result is an automatic **“Yes, and…”**, narrated as a flashy, awe-inspiring moment.\n- Afterward, the protagonist gains the **“Drained”** condition until they can rest or recover.\n\n> *Example: The Tempest channels a city-wide storm to disable a fleet of drones. Power Surge activated — drones down in a flash, but he's left reeling, off-balance, and vulnerable.*\n\nHero Points:\n\nThe protagonist begins each adventure with **3 Hero Points**. These represent not just luck, but *willpower, improvisation, and the unstoppable drive to do what’s right*.\n\nYou may spend 1 Hero Point to:\n- **Re-roll** an unfavorable result.\n- **Ask a question with advantage**, even when normally rolling at a disadvantage.\n- **Ignore a frailty or condition** for one scene.\n- **Stagger dramatically instead of falling** when a twist or failure would otherwise remove you from action.\n\nHero Points **refresh at the start of a new adventure** or after a scene of deep rest, healing, or personal reconnection (even a dramatic rooftop monologue will do).\n\nPublic Perception:\n\nSuperheroes live under scrutiny. At the end of key scenes, you may roll 1d6 to check how your recent actions shifted public opinion. This affects future events, opportunities, and even Oracle rolls involving civilians or institutions.\n\n- 1: Fear and backlash\n- 2–3: Mistrust and uncertainty\n- 4–5: Supportive but divided\n- 6: Celebrated and admired\n\nYou may optionally track **Reputation** as a tag that changes over time.\n\nCollateral Tags:\n\nDuring dramatic or large-scale scenes, introduce **Collateral Tags** to locations or situations that reflect unintended consequences of superhuman actions.\nThese can then be used as **risk factors**, **story prompts**, or **scene complications**.\n\n> *Examples: “Downtown in Rubble,” “Citizens Trapped in Fire,” “News Drone Watching,” “Power Grid Unstable.”*",
  "locations": [
    {
      "label": "Metropia",
      "detail": "A vertical megacity of neon spires and forgotten streets, torn between corporate heroes, rogue vigilantes, and rebel factions.",
      "encounters": "Drone swarm hijacks a rooftop chase; Protest escalates after metahuman interference; Superteam caught pushing their own energy drink"
    },
    {
      "label": "Jiston City",
      "detail": "Cracked concrete and rusting skylines. Retired villains play kingmakers while outlaw tech floods the black market.",
      "encounters": "Black market auction for seized superweapons; Cage fight between washed-up sidekicks; Gang war crashes into suburbia"
    },
    {
      "label": "Central City",
      "detail": "Clean suits and camera flashes. A bright surface over deep cracks.",
      "encounters": "Fundraiser ambushed on live TV; Hero scandal sparks viral fallout; Tourist from a parallel timeline drops in"
    },
    {
      "label": "The Harmony Post",
      "detail": "Media monolith and damage control empire. Sells truth with one hand, buries it with the other.",
      "encounters": "Whistleblower hiding in the datacore; Rogue AI reporter breaks containment; Broadcast countdown targeting your past"
    },
    {
      "label": "Vortex Island",
      "detail": "Orbital guns, time-locked walls, and locked-down truths. The Concord’s crown jewel.",
      "encounters": "Cell Zero breach during a peace summit; Clone flagged mid-training; Psychic sweep uncovers buried memories"
    },
    {
      "label": "Crimson Castle",
      "detail": "Baroque school for unstable powers. Red Crane vanished years ago—but her eyes might still be watching.",
      "encounters": "Forbidden wing reopens; Sudden, catastrophic mutation; Rival school launches covert extraction"
    }
  ],
  "seeds": [
    "Intercept a distress signal from a quarantined exoplanet before a rogue faction silences it permanently.",
    "Recover a reality-splitting artifact from a buried temple before Obsidian Pact cultists activate it.",
    "Defend a mutant enclave from extremist exosuits before the Crimson Castle loses its last ally.",
    "Infiltrate a hijacked Metropia broadcast tower before the villains release a hypnotic virus.",
    "Repel a coordinated assault on the skyline by the Annihilators before the city’s power grid collapses.",
    "Extract a kidnapped tech pioneer from a data-blackout zone before Supervillains United rewrite their mind.",
    "Evacuate Jiston’s old quarter before a kaiju-class bioform devours its energy infrastructure.",
    "Track an uncharted power signal to a lifeless planet before it vanishes between dimensions.",
    "Neutralize a volatile new superhuman before their rage levels an entire neighborhood.",
    "Stop a villain’s ultimatum before a kinetic warhead detonation resets downtown.",
    "Investigate a string of vanishings tied to mirror anomalies before the city’s people vanish with them.",
    "Interrupt a metahuman heist on a fusion vault before the chain reaction ignites the undercity.",
    "Intercept a rogue operative fleeing Concord custody with classified god-tech schematics.",
    "Prevent a full-scale alien incursion through a breached dimensional fold near the coast.",
    "Infiltrate a skyscraper under hostage lockdown before the villain’s demands spark panic.",
    "Disrupt a corporate infiltration by villains posing as employees before they vanish with prototype tech.",
    "Confront a chaos-mongering newcomer calling themselves The Annihilator before their next strike.",
    "Uncover the location of kidnapped mutant leaders before their DNA is sold to weapon labs.",
    "Disarm a world-ending device created by Dr. X before it completes its autonomous sequence.",
    "Push back against a villain coalition claiming Jiston as a new sovereign city-state.",
    "Stop a shadow-syndicate heist before they loot a vault of anti-super serums.",
    "Aid overwhelmed Jiston PD before the criminal element takes full control.",
    "Destroy a shipment of experimental street-drug Super Juice before it destabilizes Metropia.",
    "Divert a rampaging kaiju into containment before it breaches Metropia’s arcology walls.",
    "Unmask a legendary villain operating under the alias ‘The Shadow’ before their next strike.",
    "Retrieve stolen intel from Vortex Island’s core vault before it leaks to hostile factions.",
    "Rescue a captured young mutant before the extremists finalize a televised execution.",
    "Defend Crimson Castle from mercenaries before they breach the Zero-Level vault.",
    "Lead evacuation efforts during a continent-scale superstorm before civilian losses spike.",
    "Free hostages trapped in a collapsing high-rise before its quantum reactor fails.",
    "Expose the true identity of ‘The Conductor’ before they trigger a city-wide blackout ritual.",
    "Dismantle The Tempest’s totalitarian hold over Jiston before their weather net becomes permanent.",
    "Recover a powerful relic hidden in Central City before warring factions tear the district apart.",
    "Gather damning proof from Harmony Post archives before the conspiracy wipes the records clean.",
    "Defend Vortex Island from alien invaders seeking a relic stored in its ancient sublevels.",
    "Thwart an anti-mutant infiltration of Crimson Castle before it ends in mass detainment."
  ],
